  "name": "Stock Analysis Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Suggested Value: A two-layer stock analysis framework for US and Taiwan equities. Layer 1 evaluates fundamentals (business model, moat scoring, financial health, valuation). Layer 2 applies technical analysis (trend direction using clock positions, chip distribution for support/resistance, risk management). Outputs bilingual (English/Chinese) structured reports with actionable verdicts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `stock-analysis` (Use when the user asks to analyze a stock, evaluate whether a company is worth investing in, or…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install stock-analysis-plugin@claude-community` from `Keras870924/stock-analysis-plugin`.",
